{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "27ab50410379aa8469a9f9327b37665804fab13e908854daf092a3e4d9681a12", "ja": "いきなり★チェンジ", "zh": "突然★大变身", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e59fbf4e24d884ea0d1706a34e4d2332648fdfa7a0afabac1bc74954712dac41", "ja": "不思議な空間で目覚めた茜。目の前に現れた\n麗花（？）は、今の自由な麗花と、おしとや\nかな麗花、どちらがいいか尋ねてくる。ふと\n思い付きを口にする茜……気がつくとそこは\n撮影所で……麗花の性格が一変していた！？", "zh": "茜在不可思议的空间中醒来。出现在她面前的  \n丽花（？）询问她，现在这个自由自在的丽花，和  \n温婉文静的丽花，到底哪一个更好。茜忽然  \n说出了一个念头……回过神来，那里竟然是  \n摄影棚……丽花的性格发生了彻底改变！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "1484cbb4f63bbd36b6aefe83ccde7cc5814fc43d4fe869bdcf3c9185e92e0b7a", "ja": "ほら、茜ちゃん。\nもっとこっちに来て……。", "zh": "你看，小茜。\n再往这边来一点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "4099eb9d3af93066fd29126ae57e003ccdc57bde68709420264011f06c4ea459", "ja": "はは～ん……麗花ちゃん、これって何かのサプライズ？\n今日、何かの記念日だったっけ？", "zh": "哈哈……丽花，这是在准备什么惊喜吗？\n今天是什么纪念日来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "442994658ddddaf428bf1e27edc2d21ea812fb3e5c2df0425dffe65a33ed063e", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだよ。今日は茜ちゃんようこそ記念日！\nようこその記念に……金の斧と、銀の斧ゲーム♪", "zh": "呵呵，没错哦。今天是小茜欢迎纪念日！\n为了纪念欢迎……来玩金斧头和银斧头游戏吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "801ac47ce37d21a8a45ab64c0e344e8b37ba11ab4d98ca6726a26891eaf8faad", "ja": "自由で、元気いっぱいで、いつも茜ちゃんのプリンを\n勝手に食べちゃう麗花ちゃんと……。", "zh": "自由自在、活力十足，还总是擅自吃掉小茜布丁的丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "05aff526733b8ee74fd1ee207477147c1e2990051763eaf30c8c9d5242d1412c", "ja": "おしとやかで優しくて、茜ちゃんのプリンを\n勝手に食べない麗花ちゃん。どっちがいい？", "zh": "端庄文雅、温柔体贴，也不会擅自吃掉小茜的布丁的丽花。你觉得哪种更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "cc11f242773c5446540343af3c65409503fefc6541dbd9a0fb014ba14493901b", "ja": "ん～……。麗花ちゃん？　茜ちゃん、麗花ちゃんが\n何を言ってるのか、よくわからないんだけど？", "zh": "嗯～……丽花？小茜，我不太明白丽花在说什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "d1d68f4e5ade8665f84ed02952c1d2306a26bd527b44cc607b4c3ee0b06564aa", "ja": "だって茜ちゃん、本当は思ってたんじゃないかな？\n麗花ちゃんに振り回されるの、大変だなーって。", "zh": "因为小茜，你其实是这么想的吧？觉得总被丽花折腾得团团转，很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "e2964a417975e11ab33f6f2468d8e2755b539cf7a1a53383b8edb62f6d91c28d", "ja": "だから、これはチャンス。おしとやかな麗花ちゃんを\n選べば……茜ちゃん、きっとラクチンだよ？", "zh": "所以，这是个机会。选个文静的丽花……小茜，肯定轻松多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "54823ee0ee618b94ce343dc5f7229911f8e33cf7c3720ca52634b8c5947953d3", "ja": "や……やだなー、麗花ちゃんってば！\nそのボケは、さすがの茜ちゃんも予想外だったよ！", "zh": "哎呀，丽花真是的！\n这个冷笑话，连小茜都完全没料到哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d38d923745acfe8c7ebb2061266810dbe01cef187d96e0516d5d617b12d670e", "ja": "いくらなんでも、麗花ちゃんの中身を取り換えて\nほしいなんて、そんな……思うわけないじゃん！", "zh": "就算再怎么说，我也不可能想着要把丽花的内在换掉什么的……怎么可能嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "405fd82fb78f9b99d4309290b57db107d49961b3549f382f74e81283b519e247", "ja": "本当に？\nこんなチャンス、もう二度とないんだよ？", "zh": "真的？\n这样的机会，以后可不会再有了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "f2b86a3aaefebd7f606a3a460969ca62929a406388f038cc4777fcc201e03bec", "ja": "ん、ん～……？　そう言われると考えちゃうけど……\nあっ、そうだ！　ねえねえ、麗花ちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯，嗯～……？你这么一说，我倒是开始考虑了……啊，对了！喂喂，丽花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "8e11fc5250d96e95f230d6ba52a58a65006b78a0a63ae3797edc622ad010a5c4", "ja": "なぁに？　茜ちゃん。", "zh": "什么事？小茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "2dcd64957cdac0cacf19faefd570927a7f710cfaeb651f71f176d382153f1212", "ja": "『プリンを食べない麗花ちゃん』じゃなくて、\n『プリンをくれる麗花ちゃん』にはならないの？", "zh": "不要变成『不吃布丁的丽花』，而是变成『会送布丁的丽花』不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "d67d9aa1fc827a76f7b809d8240d628c348ea300a6db52fbd9f7d51b391abb61", "ja": "なーんて、そう上手くは……。", "zh": "不过嘛，事情可不会那么顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "c7940c0e6cac4ef2531be4f12971b5455762e3d1025f77308c7c9089001d664f", "ja": "それが茜ちゃんの望みなら、いいよ。\nそうしてあげる。", "zh": "如果那是小茜的愿望，那就好啊。\n我会满足你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "8cc45450c771bfaa059a4ef7b98003e6b3382eff3a4b311c274e19d54aecd716", "ja": "ええっ！？　ほ、ホントに！？", "zh": "诶！？真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "444e54cdbb7cce5894132d963d537dbae1f740c63e1e3990554547d39e1ed37e", "ja": "じゃあ、決まりだね。新しい麗花ちゃんを\nよろしくね、茜ちゃん！　ふふっ……。", "zh": "那就这么定了。新的丽花，就拜托你了，小茜！嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "71076efc2541dd068f6ab557bcdb3cee0508df07167a811ea18a7ed5df663441", "ja": "……むにゃ……うーん……。\n麗花ちゃ……ん……？", "zh": "……唔喵……唔——……\n丽花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d9bc273aee5fb6317277795bf5845a9b7fcd9a76529d80f6acbee0ed00eb825a", "ja": "……茜。茜、大丈夫か？\nそろそろ打ち合わせ始めるぞ？", "zh": "……茜。茜，你没事吧？\n差不多要开始开会了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "11d45074b39fdeb446361d95d223f4e4417cdb0602b84b482a713c670d38dcd8", "ja": "……はっ！？\n{$P$}ちゃん、麗花ちゃんは！？", "zh": "……哈！？\n{$P$}，丽花呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4e89249f4e0b786fdc6315f8a50a5a2d5fbd2c9b7568d8217ce135227220912d", "ja": "麗花ならそこにいるよ。それより、大丈夫か？\n随分ぐっすり寝てたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "丽花就在那边。先不说这个，你没事吧？看起来你睡得特别沉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "8ba5183e859abf8f2cf7c54964ef7b3981d5e08eb4bb6a9a2360415252804fc4", "ja": "ね、寝てた？\n茜ちゃん、寝てたの……？", "zh": "咦、睡着了？\n小茜，你睡着了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "d742dd8dd792ff1e607e072a2cae0813164ae8cc007c836db8311aadedc05612", "ja": "なーんだ！　じゃあ全部、夢だったってことだね！\nそりゃそうだよね！　それにしても変な夢だったな～。", "zh": "原来如此！那就是说，全部都是梦啦！\n也对嘛！不过话说回来，还真是个奇怪的梦啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e29e96d4d0cd1c97f2899ced6b4301c6be52ea3f21d2360815d98d6ba68aad5", "ja": "あっ、茜ちゃん、おはよう。\n目は覚めた？", "zh": "啊，小茜，早上好。  \n醒了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "018a91d710049a838801f0c2d90a0108c12f5a1c8609e7978851e6fd6453cd1b", "ja": "バッチリだよ、麗花ちゃん！\nあ、でも打ち合わせは大丈夫？　監督ちゃんは？", "zh": "精神得很，丽花！\n啊，不过，开会没问题吗？导演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "8e8c847888490e879ee6df38ba043463c086672eeb0eb35e5424ba85ad376978", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、茜ちゃん。監督さんも、\nゆっくりでいいって言ってくれたから。", "zh": "没事的，小茜。导演他也说了，\n不用着急，慢慢来就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "6e19a1700685865bf464b82114af41fd4fb087f93abb25abe837d1d0dceb81da", "ja": "無理は体に良くないもんね。\nゆっくり安全に進めていこう？", "zh": "勉强过度对身体不好嘛。我们慢慢安全地进行下去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "87e0234b6f13329379f9aec08e41f995edcdf2763d5cdb247483216d966aebf0", "ja": "う、うん。ありがと……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。谢谢你……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "b842c2665d948a63cc9beb9dc628990f278dce22996aa280a5429692bb1c33fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん。茜ちゃん、もう大丈夫\nみたいなので、私、監督さんに声を掛けてきますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。小茜看起来已经\n没问题了，我去跟导演说一声哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "6e1b3048abc3a9dd18bc305ce2d01d48b23c9c7ef4e99e1242999d8f744a4bcf", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう麗花。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "26a6c12cb5cf14895aa0f0538a72c88b90e781ac27f90d3474af90650637f13b", "ja": "……ね、ねえ{$P$}ちゃん？\n麗花ちゃん、なんだかいつもと違わない？", "zh": "……那、那个，{$P$}？\n丽花她，总觉得和平时不太一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4c972dec4afd9a4d7102f81107b80245d714678c57993d18719f48571ea66f93", "ja": "違う？", "zh": "不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "f1a7a3ee4e9f575c6b21620455008668ca3bb66c228c4ea74b7ee113e96197d8", "ja": "いつもより、なんだか落ち着いてるっていうか……\nなんか、フワフワ～ッとしてるっていうか。", "zh": "感觉比平时更加沉稳……该怎么说呢……\n又或者说，整个人都轻飘飘的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "77989e2f7720ad17831ecdf8b90b402b9cb136e975257e6278131c731f7c71f7", "ja": "麗花ちゃんがフワフワしてるのは、\nいつものことじゃないかしら？　ねえ、風花ちゃん。", "zh": "丽花总是迷迷糊糊的，不是一直都这样吗？对吧，风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d050d5c834524af289310640817bdf73f38818f56973bffa9bea7f617e6f42d0", "ja": "ええ、まあ……\nおっとりしてますしね、麗花ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯，也算是吧……\n毕竟丽花总是慢悠悠的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "78d95b19e9dac562d1f7052664f1477bd0f58c3956912d9d3a3409c4f369f820", "ja": "麗花ちゃんって、しっかりしてますよね。\n私より年下なのに、すごく落ち着いてて……。", "zh": "丽花明明比我年纪小，却很沉稳，真是个很靠谱的人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "484e2215434040612f5c20f10f9dc97333d85c35e90a2ef4e742b28a0503ac34", "ja": "そうなのよね～。おしとやかだし、よく気が付くし……\nあれは学校でも、絶対モテるはずよ！", "zh": "是啊～她既文静，又很细心……\n在学校里肯定也特别受欢迎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0156_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_04_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "8e5d7cf01b1d2bd75f43bfa2fa37afee76a06b7103abeeef3599fa782abe4024", "ja": "え……えええ～～～っ！！？", "zh": "诶……诶诶诶～～～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
